Thought: Test a simple best_single strategy using ARIMA from the full pool to see if a single strong model outperforms ensemble baselines.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool_full","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the more stable pool1 to see if it beats the best_single ARIMA baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if it improves over median and best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a best_single ARIMA but restricted to pool1 to see if limiting models improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool1","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on pool2 to see if it beats the best_single ARIMA baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool (pool3) to see if it can beat the best_single ARIMA baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test the simplest best_single strategy on the full pool to see if the best model still dominates when using all models as pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool3","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a robust dba aggregation on pool2 to see if it can beat the current median pool3 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full 19‑model pool to see if a more aggressive trimming improves over the current leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test best_single ARIMA on pool2 to see if adding ETS improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool2","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test the best_single ARIMA using the smaller pool1 to see if a more restricted set improves over current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool1","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a DBA approach on the full pool to see if it improves over the median leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pre‑computed pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full pool to see if the learned weights beat the current median leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","rf","catboost","FT_rf","DWT_catboost"],"weights":"w1"}

Thought: Try a robust median over the more stable pool4 to see if it beats the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a data‑driven weighted average (dba) on pool4 to see if it can beat the current median leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean on pool4 to see if trimming the most extreme predictions improves over the robust median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

